# class<TAB>path
#
# class is one of: owned, shaped
# path is a repository-relative file path or a glob matching files.
# A path listed nowhere here is free and carries no family constraint.
#
# owned  files must be byte-identical in every member.
# shaped files must satisfy the structural rules named in family/bin/audit.
#
# This list names what is enforced today. FAMILY.md names the full target.
# An entry is added only once the file is genuinely identical in every member,
# because an entry added early fails the audit everywhere on the first run.

